---
description: Git commit rules for AnantaOne — no Cursor attribution
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add "Made-with: Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Cursor", "Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com", or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits, PRs, or code comments.

Commits should use the project identity only (AnantaOne / company email), not personal Showrav88 branding in messages or trailers.
